dist
.superpowers

# Local settings. `DEV_API_PROXY_TARGET` and, once a keyed route is rendered, `DEV_API_KEY` go in
# `.env.local`, which `pnpm dev` and `pnpm preview` both read. Vite also loads `.env` and
# `.env.[mode]` (`.env.development` for dev, `.env.production` for preview and build), so those
# are real config files rather than local overrides. None of them belongs in the repo.
.env
.env*.local
.env.development
.env.production
